DESCRIPTION:Project: City Planning & Development Review Community Consulta
 tion Meetings\n\nThe application proposes to amend the Zoning By-law to pe
 rmit two 12-storey infill mixed-use buildings at 1747-1755\, 1771\, and 17
 73 Jane Street with 248 new residential dwelling units\, 867m2 of new non-
 residential GFA\, 158 new car parking spaces and 187 bike parking spaces. 
 The existing 14-storey rental mixed-use building on the site will be retai
 ned. A related Rental Housing Demolition application will be reviewed conc
 urrently with the Zoning By-law Amendment Application to permit the demoli
 tion of 3 rental dwelling units.\n\nType: In person
