 tion Meetings\n\nOfficial Plan and Zoning By-Law Amendment application tha
 t proposes to redesignate the subject site from 'Regeneration Areas' to 'M
 ixed Use Areas'\, and permit two mixed-use buildings with heights of 44 st
 oreys (Building A)\, and 47 storeys (Building B)\, inclusive of independen
 t 6-storey podiums for each building. The existing one-storey commercial b
 uilding is proposed to be demolished. The proposed buildings would have a 
 total gross-floor-area (GFA) of approximately 75\,165 square metres\, comp
 rised of 68\,760 square metres of residential GFA and 6\,405 square metres
  of non-residential GFA.\n\nType: In person
LOCATION:Gord and Irene Risk Community Recreation Centre\, 2650 Finch Aven
